WEBVTT

1
00:02:17.389 --> 00:02:21.309
PROTECT THE LEADER
AT ALL COSTS

2
00:08:30.011 --> 00:08:31.596
It will be fine.

3
00:08:34.224 --> 00:08:35.642
I hope so.

4
00:27:15.762 --> 00:27:18.223
What are these foreigners doing in here?

5
00:27:18.223 --> 00:27:20.392
This is against protocols and--

6
00:27:20.392 --> 00:27:21.643
Quiet!

7
00:27:23.186 --> 00:27:26.231
While Commander Cho is ill.
I am in command!

8
00:27:27.023 --> 00:27:28.775
Return to your stations!

9
00:27:34.364 --> 00:27:35.574
Yes. sir.

10
00:44:19.578 --> 00:44:22.455
Words have no wings
but they can fly a thousand miles.

11
00:44:25.333 --> 00:44:27.294
This is my home.

12
00:44:29.421 --> 00:44:31.006
Mine too.

13
01:02:33.338 --> 01:02:35.257
Sir! The Americans. they are coming in!

14
01:02:35.257 --> 01:02:36.383
Keep them out!

15
01:02:36.383 --> 01:02:37.884
We must protect our territory!

16
01:02:37.884 --> 01:02:39.261
Yes. sir! Let's go!

17
01:10:04.748 --> 01:10:06.458
Comrade Morozova.

18
01:10:06.958 --> 01:10:08.126
please come in.
